#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:46
#: e2cd3b94f9b94facb1930d30c6f126fd
msgid "On the telemetry display setup page of the TX (or telemetry widget for Horus class TXs) choose the appropriate script as the source for the display page. In the case of Taranis class, the ``yaapu7`` script is for the smaller QX7 size displays, and the ``yaapu9`` is for the Taranix 9x size displays."
msgstr ""

